caption>日式燒肉放題怎樣才能吃到新鮮肉？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日式燒肉放題怎樣才能吃到新鮮肉？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240525/870986849001672704152498.png/WEReGHlWUjyS-bhIAMsDoRdEw-wdUZchTWbTpE1m06Q\"/><figcaption>日式燒肉放題怎樣才能吃到新鮮肉？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>吃Buffet上廁所不用驗證！他好奇「換人接力吃」會被抓？前員工揭內幕</p><p>房務曝摩鐵「八爪椅」清潔方式 是否乾淨看客人鼻子靈不靈</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:24:01.402963+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1722,"images":31,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:00:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:17:37.070598+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T11:17:24.257730+00:00","content_hash":"3205dce59043e44740e1afd976b4db0626b5be542e053d6f72514b7e315ab36c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}